# Manifold level 10
# The fortress's courtyard (stage 5f): the second level, wary guards. One keeps to its west side, one
# crosses it; a lantern in its middle; the keep's gate, lit from both sides (crouched, with one of them
# out, one is not seen; smoke hides who passes). A guard that finds a lamp put out comes to light it
# again. A smoke by the start, a flare by a wall; crates to hide behind.
title The courtyard
spawn 0 1 7
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.12
sky 22.0

